<title>USA: Energy sees Citizens as key into US market.</title>
<headline>Energy sees Citizens as key into US market.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.K.-based Energy Group Plc said Monday its acquisition of Citizens Lehman Power L.L.C., is key to its planned expansion into the U.S. electricity market.</p>
<p>&quot;This is the next step to become an integrated company (in the U.S.),&quot; said Irl Engelhardt, head of Energy's Peabody Holding Co and newly-appointed board member of Citizens.</p>
</text>
